  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWinForms 0.1.0-preview.31 with immutable LibreWPF 0.1.0-preview.31 and ProGPU 0.1.0-preview.28; inherits the restored native Windows OLE clipboard path and package-only Clipboard.SetText/GetText/ContainsText/Clear acceptance coverage; builds unchanged .NET WinForms template projects through LibreWinForms.Sdk without requiring a Windows TFM; preserves hosted double-click counts for Project Explorer and designer interactions; keeps MenuStrip, ToolStrip, context menus, and dropdowns correctly positioned and interactive; retains typed X11/XWayland positioning, movement, popup, and dispatcher-pump fixes; and preserves the bounded-memory, text, image, and scene-performance improvements from the previous preview.",
